From e7584846cbc4eda878972c4d41cde82ca0aac940 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: l1l1lkk <2016895486@qq.com>
Date: Tue, 12 May 2026 12:04:39 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 08/13] @ Refactor: extract hardcoded device strings into
 centralized config

- Add lite_llama/utils/device.py with get_device() function
  Resolution order: explicit param > LITE_LLAMA_DEVICE env var > auto-detect
  Auto-detection: NPU (torch.npu) > CUDA > CPU
- Replace all hardcoded "npu:6"/"cuda" defaults with get_device()
  in 15 production files:
  - executor: model_executor, mem_manager, req_tokens_manager, cuda_graph
  - generation: generate, generate_stream, generete_with_probs
  - multimodal: llava_generate_stream, qwen3vl_generate_stream
  - models: llava
  - utils: dummy_data
  - inference
- Add --device CLI argument to cli.py, cli_llava.py, cli_qwen3vl.py

Usage:
  # Auto-detect
  python cli.py
  # Explicit device
  python cli.py --device npu:6
  # Environment variable
  LITE_LLAMA_DEVICE=npu:6 python cli.py

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
